  "details": "Downloading Avatars of non Friends just stops randomly (at any percentage or while in queue). Disabling avatar download priorization fixes it for most cases but not all if it stays off. I don't have any clue how to trigger it. It just happens randomly (but not always) after some time (always within 15 to 120 minutes so far) while staying in the same instance.\n\nIt happens in VR and Desktop. I haven't noticed this Bug on Live before. \n\nRejoining instance seems to temporary fix it so far.\n\nHere a short video of how it looks and how it looks after disabling download priorization (this download bars didn't move for minutes before i start recording): https://youtu.be/A256hWOscOs\n\nHere is more video material and Logs:\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/Hackebein/3b4e47d8b13acadd41ab7292c81128a1\n\nhttps://youtu.be/XPFL4-CMOko\n\nhttps://youtu.be/E1GpFbUUtEo\n\nhttps://youtu.be/TClE1epcbCY\n\nhttps://youtu.be/GN38zlq4hNU",
